§§ `Order 44 Rule 2 -- permission to institute proceedings`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Rule 2(1): "The jurisdiction of the Court to grant permission under section 25(2) of the Mental Health (Care and Treatment) Act to bring proceedings against a person may be exercised only by a Judge in person."
