           THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The jurisdiction of the Court to grant permission under section 25(2) of the Mental Health (Care and Treatment) Act"
           IF `who exercises it` EQUALS `A Judge` AND `the Judge exercises it in person`
           THEN JUST TRUE
           OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "may be exercised only by a Judge in person"

