-- Rule 5(3): "Where in any proceedings against a person under disability begun by originating application, that person does not appear by a litigation representative, at the hearing of the originating application,
-- the Court hearing it may appoint a litigation representative of that person in the proceedings or direct that an application be made by the applicant, for the appointment of such a litigation representative."
