           THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where a single sum of money is paid into Court under Order 14, Rule 1, in satisfaction of causes of action arising under the Civil Law Act and that sum is accepted, the money must be apportioned between the different causes of action by the Court" -- the duty does not arise (QD); `o 44 r 12(1) the duty to apportion the money arises` answers JUST FALSE
